# The pinned Firecracker release (spec §11.3): firecracker and jailer,
# the static musl builds, shipped in the Linux agent tarball's bin/.
# The SHA-256s are of the release tarballs, as the release's own
# firecracker-v<version>-<arch>.tgz.sha256.txt give them.
#
# 1.17.0 (2026-09-10) is the newest release; it adds official support for
# 6.18 guest kernels, which needs at least 1.16.1.
